us,United States,11350208456,2024-06-06T07:40:04-07:00,Discord is a good app! But I wish for one thing..,"As a following discord user for along perhaps four/five years, discord was always and the best app to communicate and make friends on. Discord always had the best platform to chat and interact, I had made a few friends by myself and honestly, with out discord I wouldn’t have friends to support me through out this way! Although, in my case. I wish there was something we can go along by the old overlay and messages, some sort like of setting for the old discord. Surely in some cases people would agree it would be easier, clicking on the box and then seeing your messages with your friends and so, right? In my case, I have adhd and mostly it is a little difficult for me to know where and exactly I’m along clicking on. Since I was on discord a long time, it is mostly for me a little difficult to understand the new features in discord. No hate to discord in any way! I love the app and community and I have been bought nitro and so to support discord themself’s, their team has help me a lot in situation’s like the phone number problem in 2020. Discord is overall the best app for a online community and to chat on, despite anything it’ll always be the number one app to chat on with my friends! But, for at least anything, I would appreciate if the messages design layer along can possibly have a small update for where it was the old one, perhaps prefer maybe a setting for new and the old. Like how discord themself, did it before.

