in,India,12252331693,2025-01-31T02:41:08-07:00,Discord,"Discord is a social space among which you can interact as a community, as friends, or anything else alike. Discord's moderation is mediocre, with barely any attention spent on many users being reported as harassers, p***philes, and even r***sts. These kinds of users explore the foundations of Discord frequently, and often dwell in servers that advertise themselves as an ""e-girl"" or ""dating"" server. They promote this, and garner hundreds of thousands of members that often end up as victim to the ploys of these sick people. Time and time again, Discord has proven that they only prioritise a quick buck over the safety of their customers, let alone members. Their moderation is poor, servers go unnoticed, dating servers are right there on the library in trending servers, with clear intentions to promote dating, despite it violating their own TOS. It's beautiful how, despite being practically a social media app, they don't consider the safety of their users and promote this kind of behaviour, that opposes their own TOS. Zero self-respect?

Do what you want with this review, Discord. However, in the end, if you don't do anything right with your moderation and step up to do something, you all will be the center of a trending news story. Good luck. I wish a safe stay to all the users—recent or old.",2,264.0,Kenyuurei,11
in,India,10674846046,2023-12-09T07:40:19-07:00,Used to be good,"I have been using discord since Nov 2017. There was nothing like discord back then, there were things like TeamSpeak, which weren't straight forward. I have loved using this app since then, but I have seen the gradual shift in the company's goals. The corporate greed got to them. You could see changes being made that were only made to extract more money from the users. They added paywalls for things that were free, they removed a lot of things from the Nitro basic, and moved them all to the upper tier, to the point where Nitro basic is basically useless. They also keep making changes just to make changes, with nothing actually being gained. For example, the recent overhaul of the UI. Oh I wish discord mobile app had a different UI said no one. It's soo bad to the point it feels they took a step backwards. Everything used to feel seem less, it all worked and made sense. Now I feel soo much friction while using the app. And it is not even the kind of friction where you get used to it, none of the UI element placements make sense. None of it functions smoothly. It makes me wonder, did anyone at discord even use this before approving it?",3,207,Shamrezzz,6
in,India,6743441796,2020-12-11T19:01:07-07:00,Some voice channel glitches in IPads,"So since a few weeks, everybody’s voice in discord has been super laggy for me but my voice to them is just fine. I checked and it’s not connected with my download speed and when I call them their voice are just fine but it’s in the voice channels, and when I start my VPN, the voice become good as well. I saw some more complaints like this and hope the people at discord fix them because it’s quite annoying. Otherwise the app is very good and it’s a 5 star if not for the little glitches. It’s been very helpful to me and my friends, we have used it for a whole year now and I have to say it’s very diverse than other apps like WhatsApp, you have the ability to add the bots for games and moderation too which is very brilliant. Thank You!",5,51.0,CardinalPlayz,180
in,India,9040748828,2022-09-01T03:57:07-07:00,The best social networking site!,"Discord is one of the best social networking sites, you can join big community servers and interact with people whenever you want to. What makes Discord even more engaging is that people can add bots to their servers, Discord has many good fun bots, you can play games in Discord servers because of those bots. Discord also has some other good features such as: servers can add custom emojis and stickers so the members can have a better conversation, servers can also add roles and give them to the members and you can stream any game in high quality. Discord is a heaven not only for gamers but for everyone! One more thing I would like to address is that their are many scams on Discord, so be careful. You should also read articles related to cyber security before using Discord.",5,142.0,Wordsmith V.,3
in,India,7680800307,2021-08-11T07:03:32-07:00,Pushing Nitro purchases too hard,"If you upload anything not matter how small the file, when you try to send message, a pop-up will remind you about higher file size limit with nitro removing any text you had added as description for the image or file.. and you have to type that all over again!

