in,India,6104684990,2020-06-21T07:35:05-07:00,"It is a really good app, but needs improved moderation","Discord is a really good app. While most people use it to communicate with each other for games and such, it can even be used for school competitions and such. But the reason I have given 4 stars is because the moderation is very cringe worthy as most moderators abuse their power, or use it for very small reasons even though this app is 12+. There should be valid reasons and proof for bots to ban people from discord servers, and a strike system should be used instead. I feel that this app should really change its moderation and make it fair for a 12+ app, it just doesn’t seem mature or compulsory, and it is very abusable. That is my review, and this is just my opinion. Someone else might say the moderation is good or outstanding but I don’t think it is. Anyways I hope you found this helpful.

Yash Raj Mehta",4,26.0,Yash Raj Mehta,24
