in,India,13992033251,2026-04-24T07:07:04-07:00,Screen share for PS5,"Discord is an amazing platform for communication, but one major limitation on PS5 really needs attention.

Right now, if you’re using Discord on PlayStation 5, there’s no proper way to stream your screen directly to a Discord voice channel. Instead, you’re forced to use PS Share, which only works with other PS5 users. This completely breaks the experience—especially if you’re in a Discord VC with friends on different platforms.

The biggest issue is that you have to leave your Discord voice chat just to share your screen through PlayStation. That defeats the whole purpose of Discord as a cross-platform communication tool. It makes streaming gameplay to friends inconvenient and honestly frustrating.

It would be a huge improvement if Discord added native screen streaming support on PS5, just like it works on PC and mobile. Being able to stay in a voice channel and stream your gameplay seamlessly would make the experience much smoother and more enjoyable.

Please consider adding this feature—it's something a lot of users would genuinely benefit from.",4,325.0,Ghost_king141,0
