in,India,14525554268,2026-09-08T07:48:20-07:00,"⭐⭐⭐ Discord Does Most Things Well, But Quality Comes at a Cost","Discord is pretty good on PC and honestly does most things it says it will. The voice delay is really low, so talking with friends feels smooth. The upload limit is also pretty reasonable.

