gb,United Kingdom,9037984109,2022-08-31T07:40:44-07:00,Great but needs customised notification tones,"Discord is a great app that I rely on heavily, but it desperately, desperately needs to enable different tones for different Discord servers.

I rely on Telegram a lot but, unlike Telegram – which allows you to assign a different notification to different channels – there is no such functionality with Discord.

With Telegram, I can tell from the tone whether it is a notification that needs my immediate attention.

I need to be able to do the same with Discord.

As someone who gets over 100 notifications from Discord per day, I have to manually check the notification on my phone to determine if it needs my attention, as the tone is the same for every channel on every server.

This is indescribably inconvenient and wastes a lot of my time checking notifications on channels and servers that I do not wish to fully mute.

Please add customisable notification tones as soon as possible. It would be nice to be able to have custom notification tones for individual channels in a server, too.

Other than that, it’s a great app.",4,141.0,Alex JT,0
