gb,United Kingdom,7126424856,2021-03-20T22:00:13-07:00,I love discord but the app’s abysmal.,"For the last two months, it has been completely unusable. iOS 14, iPhone 8+ that runs way more demanding (theoretically) applications like Genshin Impact and other games struggles to run this smoothly. 

