gb,United Kingdom,13737445516,2026-02-11T04:40:44-07:00,"Data leaks, online predators and privacy breaches","Hey so we all know about the previous data leaks and such but now they wanna make it mandatory to identify yourself via a photograph of your face or your government ID if you want to use all of its features. Nitro is overpriced, they’re going to be using tech that reads your messages to “determine your age” if you don’t verify your age. So, in either situation you’re jeopardising your identity and private information. If you think you’re safe, no you’re not. Accounts are easy to hack and if you briefly look into Discord’s past data breaches you’ll see its issues. As well as the age verification system putting minors at risk by basically giving predators an age selection catalogue. DO NOT SUPPORT THIS!!!!",1,315.0,0_Niko_0,1
