ca,Canada,10719466809,2023-12-19T13:26:38-07:00,The new UI,"Please for the love of god revert the UI update. I’m in school for UX design and this is genuinely such a case study on what not to do. Why remove the swipe to see people online in servers? It feels more isolating and empty, and the DM’s now on the bottom makes them easy to overlook and the new page for them is so clunky. It is okay to be wrong, but please fix the mistakes so many people are complaining about. I will be cancelling my nitro until the app is fixed.",1,209.0,Itsjustmaji,3
