ca,Canada,10902325899,2024-02-04T14:08:46-07:00,Feedback on Recent IOS Updates,"In my opinion, Discord has become a little too clittered for use. I am severely visually impaired, and the new layouts are very difficult for me to manage due to multiple things happening at once. With the old layout, Discord was very easy to work with and communicate through. 

I think there should be a ""Legacy Mode"" added to settings, and that we should be able to opt in or out of using the current layout. Considering many different people's feedback on the subject, I think that it would be a proper addition to the app, both as an accessibility feature and as a way to make things fair for both parties. (""Both parties"" referring to people who prefer Legacy Discord and people who prefer the new Discord update)",3,214.0,BIGrod98,2
