ca,Canada,10731574414,2023-12-22T08:05:21-07:00,End of 2023 update,"This app was useable. Not as great as the desktop, but it was similar enough that most of it worked quite easily. With the new ui change, that no one asked for, it has greatly decreased accessibility and so many long-term users are upset. Discord can change their brand to stay fresh without screwing up the entire layout and design of the mobile app. From what I’ve seen, text size accessibility has been removed, the colour contrast of text on the darker background makes reading for people with visual sensitivity difficult, and it makes it so regular users have to completely relearn how to use their main source of messaging. No one asks for these updates, and if discord continues to change what people were happy with, it may not be top of its market much longer.",2,209.0,LemonJuice978,1
