ca,Canada,10712655643,2023-12-18T09:40:44-07:00,New UI is a Disaster,"The app used to work fine, but recently they updated the app with a new UI.
I don’t mind the new look, but with it they took several useful features away. 
The old UI used to show me how many unread messages I had in my DMs, and the accounts with messages would always be available at the top until I read them. Now, I can still see my *total* number of unread messages, but when I open the DM section it only shows me who is read and who is unread, without telling me if each person sent me one message or sent me twenty. It also no longer puts unread messages at the top. I have to scroll down and click on every blue dot I see if I want to get rid of the big red “20” next to my DMs icon.
They also removed the option to search an entire server’s messages. You can only search in each channel individually now. Why is Discord removing features? There’s no good reason for any of this.",1,208.1,KiwiExpert,1
