ca,Canada,10687691045,2023-12-12T16:14:17-07:00,The Worst UI Update in History,"Whomever thought it was a great idea to completely change the UI for the app needs to be fired. Forcing such an awful update on everyone without the option of sticking with the desktop-mirror version is just ludicrous. This new UI in NOT user friendly, the formatting is atrocious, having to tap on the channels instead of swiping like normal is asinine, having to click on the hour glass icon to view who’s online in a channel and view other tabs is annoyingly absurd and only being able to view the other person’s pins in a DM as opposed to both or yours is just plain dumb. The other issue is that if you have bluetooth headphones connected to your phone, it no longer provides the option to switch to your headphones, it only allows the audio output to be speaker directly from your phone; It is extremely annoying. There was absolutely nothing wrong with the original desktop-mirror UI, it functioned phenomenally, had a nice classic look to it and was EXTREMELY user friendly compared to this terrible new update. 
The worst part is, the Discord team, whomever, just saying, “we know it’ll take some getting used to, but we’ll forward up your feedback.” What a joke… NOW it just feels like a huhe inconvienence to use the app and it’s frustrating to have to think about using it. CHANGE IT BACK or lose your Nitro customers, your choice.",1,208.0,Kirv0,1
