au,Australia,10898300892,2024-02-03T13:40:26-07:00,Worst update yet,"This new layout and everything is so stressful to even look at. I’ve used discord for many years and it’s my main source of communication with my friends, but it’s just sad seeing this app fall. I just don’t understand how they need to put something new and shiny on it so often, no one was complaining until they started changing everything which on top of that has made the app work less and less. With every update the app gets worse and worse with bugs, all my friends and myself included have had to closes this app constantly because chats won’t load, calls won’t work properly, sometimes my whole keyboard won’t load. Ever since this update I have not had a single day where I haven’t had to shut off the app. Another thing I’ve noticed is the lack of care for customers, all complaints are ignored and are replied with a half effort message directing them to a app directory page. It’s clear they do not care what people think of the update because they’re still getting their money. BRING BACK THE OLD UI!!",1,214.0,F1ishbowl,1
au,Australia,6766130295,2020-12-18T02:34:36-07:00,Let me use this stupid app!,"Let me just say this app id excellent for calling mobile and other! It has a variety of amazing features and qualities. But, as good as this app is it does have its flaws... Firstly it keeps on logging me out of my account saying 'somethings going on here'. Although this is to rid bots and other things its annoying because it keeps on doing it to me just whenever i have three people im not friends with in my dm's, but i just have people in my dms because there my friends that im waiting for them to accept my friend request. This makes me have to create an entirely new account and try to contact my friends with them. Ive made about 6 accounts so far and all of them have logged me out if. This was so annoying because i wasn't doing anything wrong so i just quit discord. This wasn't the only flaw. Whenever i tried changing my profile picture it made the profile the corner of the picture i chose. This too made discord very annoying! Overall i would not recommend this app to anyone who cant verify their account, though if they are able too then i would recommend it.",1,52.0,where is 1.14,22
au,Australia,3349617393,2018-10-27T04:55:40-07:00,A serious lack of settings.,"Hey! Great app. Thoroughly enjoy using discord, the view is quite pretty and I usually get all my notifications. I just have one issue.
