au,Australia,11348651210,2024-06-05T21:44:25-07:00,Top tier fr,"Deff not the app that’s the problem. Has great templates for servers, and comes in handy messaging friends. Very fun for the extra stuff they provide like games together on calls, cool profile affects ect. Discord is one of the main messaging apps I use to stay in close contact with people. There is definitely a lot of buttons and things on discord so if you’re new at first it is overwhelming but you do get the hang of it. Very fun to make your own servers, edit own profiles, give friends nicknames, play games on discord, use cute gifs and stickers customised, and much more. Love every update they come up with and continue using it!!💗",5,232.0,madisò,0
au,Australia,9376152690,2022-12-08T20:56:50-07:00,Please fix it!,"I have been enjoying the app until this new update. Every time i open discord it stays at the loading screen for longer then usual, when it finally loads it kicks me out. I’ve tried everything to fix this, etc deleting and reinstalling the app and turning off things in the app that might’ve been causing this but no, It’s still not loading. I’ve looked at some other reviews and they’ve said the same thing. No, it’s not because of my wifi or my data or my phone, it’s because of this horrible “fixed bugs” update! Overall (Not including this bad update) the app has been working well for me but i need this glitch to be fixed soon! Please stop it from kicking me out.",3,156.0,Eve1yn79,0
au,Australia,14195217093,2026-06-17T16:00:23-07:00,Updated Review: process not clear,"Thank you for your reaponse. Please make the process of accessing restricted servers clear in the message gotten when trying to enter. Right now it basically says “restricted on ios, go to here to learn more.” I went to the link and had an admittedly quick glance and saw nothing. Please add to the message you get when trying to go to the server that you can change setting on desktop as not everyone will go look at the link, or like me would have just glanced. I still dont know if the answer is in that link. But it would have made things a lot easier if it was in the original message on the discord app.",4,333.0,amy_agatha,0
au,Australia,2401094942,2018-04-09T00:21:47-07:00,Excellent social and gaming communications platform.,"The following is my opinion based on personal use and gaming community management.

This platform is rock solid for keeping in touch with friends enabling excellent control across the board; direct calls and individual server management.  Individual servers can have set rules and rolls for both text and voice.  All for the amazing price of “free”.  

If you have cash, it is worth throwing some dollars at the developers to say thank you.

For community, the ease at which members can freely create their own servers results in community splintering.  The benefit of community and meeting like minded individuals across a large range of games is hindered.  

I would love to see better community tools similar to a town square with shops all around.  Meet new people before heading of to play.

The developers are responsive with new features regularly coming online.

In my opinion, this is the best communication tool at this time.  I look forward to watching how this develops in the future.

Thanks developers.

Highly recommended.",5,2.2.9,2_islands,1
au,Australia,9871899944,2023-04-28T17:16:40-07:00,iOS restrictions: Stop censoring adult content for adults,"There’s been complaints about this for years and nothing has changed, so I’m writing a review. Discord and the iOS app store have censored NSFW content for people over 18 who are able to view the content on other platforms on PC. Every time the app updates or the app is redownloaded, the problem of access pops up again and then we have to approve our worthiness for each individual NSFW server through a PC that isn’t bound to the iOS store. This us for approved and vetted members of nsfw servers. It’s beyond a safety protocol. You know I‘m not under 18. You know that I am vetted on the server. You know I’ve toggled to accept nsfw content on your platform. So stop censoring this content for adults because discord and apple can’t figure out their consultation. This is an overreach and stifles my interest in subscribing to your app.",1,175.0,Flixstix,0
au,Australia,7142137043,2021-03-25T01:19:22-07:00,Read please✨,"YES. i love discord its amazing. But i have a request. Can you please make a feature for talking to people. Can you please add a setting so when you type one mesage they dont receive it in notifacations. I mean for example, you want to text your friend a important notice about school, its 2am and they are sleeping. You can hold the mesage bar thing and a feature called ’deliver without notifacations’. Another thing you can add is a time of when they receive the notifacations. For example ’deliver at 7:am’ or something and then you send a mesage and they receive it in the morning. Thank you for reading this✌️✌️",5,65.0,eEvEe ThE PoTaTo,0
au,Australia,14026321792,2026-05-03T22:49:33-07:00,The moderation nowadays is ridiculous - As someone who's 4+ Year account was banned.,"Just a warning for those who've lost their accounts, and hopefully Discord support will see this, as their ticket system is absolutely terrible and hasn't ever helped me. 

