- i get constant lagginess, for example: i press a certain channel/dm then it takes 10 secs to register, and when i text people it lags and if i go to a different dm or channel it sends it there, it’s super frustrating waiting for everything to finally register and happen. I love this app, but it’s super annoying that an update ruined my experience, before i updated it was smooth as silk, now it’s making my ipad/iphone hot and it wasn’t making it hot before i updated.

• call disconnects after about 2-5 mins when ipad/iphone is locked. im always in a call at night, with my boyfriend due to us not seeing each other because of covid. but ever since i updated, it leaves when i turn off my phone (locked it). it’s also super annoying waking up to me not being in call anymore, ive tried everything i found on the internet for ways to help but it still leaves, so now i have turned my ipad/iphone screen timer so it never turns off so i won’t leave the call. but i shouldn’t have to do that because before the update it will never leave after i turn off/lock my phone. please do something to help, i hate leaving my devices on all night so i won’t leave the call, it’s probably very much killing my ipad/iphone but it’s what i have to do to very much guarantee i stay in call.

• when i’m watching a screen share, it randomly disconnects me and with the lagginess of the app i have to restart because nothing registers.

- so moral of the story is please figure out what’s wrong, with the lagginess and constant disconnect/leaving of call on ios after device is locked/or turned off",3,37.0,Quincy167,0
au,Australia,14325372726,2026-07-20T00:32:55-07:00,Beautiful app but one problem.,"I wanted this app to message some of my friends and to make one, but within a few weeks of use, I got kicked out of my account for sending a funny meme that just said ‘Find x’ as in algebra but the person instead circled x and wrote found it. Since I was worried about what I did, I asked my friend who recommended discord to me in the first place and they said the AI might’ve taken it as child porn. So long story short, I am asking that you improve discord AI so it is more fair to those who use. I would also create another account but I have only one email pretty much and if I used that same email I would most likely not be able to create one, so please, fix the discord AI scanner.",3,337.0,A_Personwholives,0
au,Australia,7597442351,2021-07-20T03:43:34-07:00,"Overall great service, decent app","I've been using Discord for years, and I've always loved it. It's a good free chat service that still has many features. Some small features are locked behind a subscription called Discord Nitro, like increased file size limit, animated emoji usage, extended profile customisation, and a few other small things. Now whilst the service itself is great, the mobile app is not the best. It can be buggy at times, and is missing MANY features that the desktop and web apps have, which is a bit of a shame, but not too bad.

I give it.a 4/5 overall. Great service with many free features, but a mobile app that doesn't amaze.",4,83.0,charsesan,0
