au,Australia,11035606491,2024-03-12T00:59:48-07:00,Search functionality has taken a nosedive in recent months.,"The relatively recent mobile overhaul definitely has tread on some toes, and while I’ve been able to adapt to the UX changes (some of which are great- like being able to preview all photos in a channel!) the search functionality has dramatically worsened.

