Discord is certainly much better because you can even have groups up to 32 THOUSAND members. As well as having so many members, it's usually not laggy at all! It's really cool.

In addition to this, Discord has a feature where you can add reactions to a message. This is my favourite feature of all time because since the last time I used Skype, there wasn't that at all.

By the way... Discord also has bots that you can invite in your server. They can moderate the server, make it so you can ""level up"" with their bot and view your profile as well. It's quite fun using commands. 

