au,Australia,6653117707,2020-11-16T13:25:41-07:00,One of the best social apps I’ve ever downloaded!,"Discord is a wonderful voice-and-video chat that changed my life for the better. Honestly. Free group chats, emotes, servers and more?! How much better can you get? 

I also really appreciate the new safety precautions that have been put in place, such as reporting stuff to the Trust and Safety team. It really makes me feel safer and happier to talk to people and to be able to report any grooming or suspicious messages.

I’ve been able to connect to new people, and get to know my friends better than ever. 

One thing I will say though, is that there are a lot of “Free Discord Nitro” server that end up phishing and hacking accounts that join. Apart from the GiveawayBot or other verified Discord Bots, don’t click emotes on Free Nitro servers. Report them if you can, as they are mostly fake and will try and attack you or get your data.

