au,Australia,11190726561,2024-04-22T22:43:44-07:00,Please fix discord,"Bro discord used to be a 5/5 app but for some dumb reason they updated it and now it’s super user unfriendly on iPhone, it’s horrible. They just keep coming out with worse and worse fixes. 

