Also navigating to DMs was far better with the original design of the app, now you need to press a small icon at the bottom of your screen, it was easier to navigate to dms before, swiping left and right was a cool design loved by most, I don’t know why it was changed",1,226.0,(good) game review,0
au,Australia,7683696353,2021-08-12T02:02:19-07:00,no basis for such lax startup assists.,"no basis for such lax startup assists. It is a pervading fact that it takes an eager mind to get the setup done in one sitting. It is casual

so i think the way it gets put together has more shadowy areas than necessary. The spectrum is by far the best, but the tutorials are all for server hosts. There needs to be tutorial across the board and mandatory. It seems it follows the pattern of “ get good when u want to “. That is wasting peoples time, point blank.

The mobile notifications and personal notifications seem to be reversed.
I’ve been cut from read write to read only. No stress, but I get chat and images that I’m apparently disallowed from seeing?

That is a sham on notifications altogether. What, now I get to find out I was let through a banner on my phone, but not able to catch the full scenario? Why get that notification? Why the salt from randoms, when the app is committed to fine tuning and trimming the server from the beginning. 

