nz,New Zealand,7145630828,2021-03-25T23:15:37-07:00,"Unsafe and outclassed in VC by Teamspeak, useful for private chats.","If you are going to be chatting for a majority of your time on Discord through voice calls, just rent a TS server. It’s simple, accessible and high quality compared to Discord’s practically authoritarian rules on bandwidth.

