The privacy on Discord is a burden and a pro, conversations never being tracked with data and a guarantee of safe person to person communication. On the other hand, Discord’s privacy makes it a lot easier for predators to take advantage of others; something not rare to the landscapes of Discord life.",3,65.0,Gezyyumi,0
